        <p>We deepen scholarly inquiry and challenge the boundaries of disciplinary knowledge.</p>
        <img class="pillar-icon" src="images/icon-expertise.svg" width="64" height="64" alt="" />
      </li>
      <li class="pillar">
        <h3>Collaboration</h3>
        <p>We work across fields to build sustained, trans-disciplinary research and relationships.</p>
        <img class="pillar-icon" src="images/icon-collaboration.svg" width="64" height="64" alt="" />
      </li>
      <li class="pillar">
        <h3>Exchange</h3>
